OL,5,G2000 The World In A Painting:
OL,6,G     Caravaggio's Comb
OL,7,     FWith details from Caravaggio's
OL,8,     Fpainting, explore the history of
OL,9,     Fivory trade routes from Africa and
OL,10,     Fthe Arctic to 16th-century Europe.
OL,11,G2115 Beyond The Brush
OL,12,     FSaturn Devouring His Son: Chart
OL,13,     Fthe darkness, fear and haunting
OL,14,     Fimagination that fuelled Francisco
OL,15,     FGoya's work, including the
OL,16,     Fturbulent times that guided each
OL,17,     Fbrutal stroke. (S1, ep 3)
